    { "name": "privacy_title", "value": "User Agreement & Privacy Policy" },
    { "name": "privacy_body", "value": "Welcome to transmissionbtm. Please read and agree to the following terms before using the app:\n\n1. This app is based on the open-source Transmission engine (GPLv2) and is a neutral BitTorrent download tool. It ships no torrents, trackers, or search indexes, and provides no copyrighted content. Content you add and download via this app belongs to its rights holders, and you are solely responsible for it.\n\n2. This app is \"local-first, minimal collection\": no sign-up, no collection, and no uploading of any personal information. Torrents, magnet links, and downloaded files that appear in the app are stored only in the local directory you choose and are never transmitted elsewhere.\n\n3. To complete downloads, this app needs network access, background running, and other necessary permissions, used solely for its core function and never for any other collection or reporting.\n\n4. For the full privacy policy, tap the \"View Privacy Policy\" link below." },
